    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "Which details? Midjourney lists seven: subject, medium, environment, lighting, colour, mood, and composition. When a picture comes back wrong, it's usually because one of these was left for it to guess.",
